2026-07-26T10:39:58.9380610Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-26T10:39:58.9381335Z i /tmp/RtmpgMyeRg/duckdb
2026-07-26T10:39:58.9381836Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T10:39:58.9382409Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T10:39:58.9383321Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T10:39:58.9384195Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:39:58.9385379Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:39:58.9386527Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
